                                  "name": "sp2",
                                  "fill": "#a1a1aa",
                                  "content": "North America continues to lead in total revenue, contributing 35% of global sales. Asia Pacific showed the strongest growth at +18.5% YoY, driven primarily by expansion in Southeast Asian markets.",
